--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ADDED  exploit/src/targets/annap-ALI-AN00_9.0.0.220/target.h
       Honor X50 (ALI-AN00), MagicOS 9.0.0.220, kernel
       5.10.236-android12-9-gf68ed03ce0d2. Kernel-symbol offsets measured from
       the device's own boot image, not copied from another model.

ADDED  exploit/src/targets/annap-ALI-TN00_9.0.0.230/target.h
       Honor X50 (ALI-TN00), MagicOS 9.0.0.230, kernel
       5.10.236-android12-9-g4b262e5255ed. Same method.

       Both profiles inherit struct-layout offsets (FAKE_TASK_*, WAITER_*,
       TASK_CRED_OFF, MM_OWNER_OFF, and the random_table + 0x100 boot_id entry)
       from the upstream 80 GT profile. Those are NOT verified on either X50
       device; each is flagged inline in the target.h files.

ADDED  docs/ALI-AN00-TN-COMPARISON.md    two-boot symbol diff, build verification
