CVE-2026-43499 ("GhostLock")
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A use-after-free in remove_waiter(), kernel/locking/rtmutex.c, on the futex
requeue-PI proxy-lock rollback path. Upstream fix commit 3bfdc63936dd ("rtmutex:
Use waiter::task instead of current in remove_waiter()"), landed in Linux 7.1.
Reported by VEGA at Nebula Security.

